Z||000000||turbo86se||06-12-2000||04:00 PM||||Yeah Buddy!!!  Today I picked up my decklid from the paint shop!!  I bought TOM's rear scoop for my black 86SE.  It looks sooo good, like it came straight from the factory.  At first I was just going to have it bolted on, but then I decided to have it glassed on.  To prevent the spoiler and scoop looking cramped, I installed the factory spoiler about an inch farther to the rear of the decklid than the factory mounting spots.<P>Sorry, no pics!!  YET, and those of you going to the Fiero show in VA, you will see it!!<P>THANKS FOR THE HELP DXR_DAD!!!  Couldn't have gotten the nerve to start cutting without ya!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
